RVSAO's cross-correlation templates, from the RVSAO 2.8.5 distribution
(rvsao$templates/), redistributed with harwood under RVSAO's notice:
see LICENSES/RVSAO-COPYRIGHT. Readme is RVSAO's own description of them.

In xcsao, rvsao$templates/<name> and --tempdir rvsao$templates read from here, and a
bare template name that is not in the working directory is looked for here too.
